  "description": "Conversion of dwelling into two flats (2 X 2 beds); single and two storey rear extension; front porch; separate amenity space; bin and cycle stores; vehicle access; landscaping",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;By reasons of the lack of evidence to demonstrate that the proposed vehicle crossover would have no damage to existing street trees and the proposal would adversely diminish the public grass verges on the pavement, the proposal would detract from the existing suburban character of the streetscene and the wider area which fails to contribute to streetside greenery contrary to policies G7 of the London Plan (2021) and policies DM22 and DM23 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Insufficient information has been submitted to the satisfaction of the Local Planning Authority that the proposed development would be resistant and resilient to surface water flooding contrary to policies SI 12 of the London Plan (2021) and DM9 of the Harrow Development Management Policies (2013).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
